    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "It sounds like the consensus you're describing is pretty much locked in. But what about the people who say this \"spectrum\" idea is just a way to push a particular ideology and that it actually contradicts basic biological principles? Is there any actual scientific debate left on this, or is anyone who disagrees just considered being \"anti-science\" or wrong by the mainstream experts?",
